  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Once upon a time, there lived a family who hunted animals for sport. Their actions were met with punishment, cursing all their descendants through the maternal lineage to live a life transforming into animals.\n\nFlash forward to modern day times, where all relatives of the family have adapted to their circumstances, and have found their own happiness while living a comfortable life. But for the boys and girls entering puberty, this time feels extra special and different...\n\nWhat does \"affection\" mean? Why does it change us? This is a story about a special family going through their adolescence--a difficult time for anyone.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
